	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Adafruit BMP388 precision pressure/temperature breakout, STEMMA QT version (product 3966). I2C when CS is left open (pulled up on the module); address 0x77 with SDO open, 0x76 with SDO to GND. INT is the sensor interrupt output. One 1x8 header. Pad positions from Adafruit's published Eagle board (github.com/adafruit). Board outline on F.Fab.")
